# vegeta targets for control-plane / web HTTP load. Copy to controlplane.targets
# and edit the hostnames for your environment (staging vs prod).
#
# These defaults are READ-ONLY and UNAUTHENTICATED so they are safe to run:
GET https://api.trqsh.uz/healthz
GET https://trqsh.uz/
GET https://app.trqsh.uz/

# --- Auth endpoints (uncomment to load the credential path) -----------------
# NOTE: /v1/auth/* is per-IP rate limited (5 sustained / 10 burst by default), so a
# single-source attack will be throttled to ~429s almost immediately — that proves
# the limiter works but does NOT measure raw capacity. To capacity-test the auth
# path, raise the limits in a STAGING env or drive it from many source IPs.
#
# POST https://api.trqsh.uz/v1/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
# @login-body.json
